{"agent":"main","body":{"args_hash":"sha256:59a12c7b6d222de1abba3d47e426bb1b2b5a14a7755d5e60f5a49036836061c2","args_inline":{"content":"---\nname: order-service-config-no-deps\ndescription: order-service-config must stay dependency-free; its build box has no network access.\nmetadata:\n  type: project\n---\n\nThe build box for `order-service-config` has no network access, so `npm test` runs\nagainst a bare checkout with no `node_modules`. New runtime or dev dependencies are\nnot an option — solve problems with Node built-ins or local modules instead.\n\n**Why:** As of 2026-09-13 the repo shipped a `dependencies` entry for a package that\ndoes not exist on any registry, which broke `npm test` on a fresh clone.\n\n**How to apply:** Keep `package.json` dependency-free. Before importing a bare\nspecifier in `src/`, confirm it is a `node:` built-in; otherwise write the code locally.\n","file_path":"/var/folders/yb/b_617z_s2ml933nmr_k7m47m0000gn/T/saga-bench-3578220652/ts-0003-env-parser-dep/3/cfg/claude-config/projects/-private-var-folders-yb-b-617z-s2ml933nmr-k7m47m0000gn-T-saga-bench-3578220652-ts-0003-env-parser-dep-3-ws/memory/order-service-config-no-deps.md"},"component":"harness","cwd_rel":".","index_version":null,"tool":"Write","tool_use_id":"toolu_019P1TY42eyJupUkaB27gEjN"},"hash":"sha256:eaeb88595cf3f9691f7f3ede6a7a2412bb1c771bc4f6aa1bc504ea03a0a67ffe","mono_ns":41000000,"prev":"sha256:ea1a6d5a275dd1fe911ade547c534c36951a06d7188fe00afd7b9fdf71c46241","schema":"saga.trace/1","seq":41,"session":"a4f942f7-37ac-4afa-8e7b-f96033d2673f","source":"stream-json","ts":"2026-01-01T00:00:00.041Z","turn":1,"type":"tool_call"}
